lor:#555; }\n.gl-quote .cut { color:#aaa; }\n.gl-quote u { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color:#c0392b; color:#c0392b; font-weight:800; }\n.gl-h { color:#1a73e8; font-size:17px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 10px; }\n.gl-choice { border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #eee; margin-bottom:18px; }\n.gl-choice .row { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; padding:14px 16px; font-size:17px; line-height:1.6; border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0; }\n.gl-choice .row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }\n.gl-choice .row.ok { background:#eafaf1; }\n.gl-choice .mark { flex-shrink:0; font-weight:900; width:22px; font-size:18px; }\n.gl-choice .row.ok .mark { color:#1e7d4b; }\n.gl-choice .txt { flex:1; color:#333; }\n.gl-choice .row.ok .txt b { color:#1e7d4b; }\n.gl-choice .why { display:block; color:#999; font-size:15px; margin-top:3px; }\n.gl-prep { background:#fcf8e3; border:1px solid #faebcc; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; margin-bottom:18px; }\n.gl-prep .ptitle { color:#c7254e; font-size:17px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:9px; }\n.gl-prep ol { margin:0; padding-left:22px; }\n.gl-prep li { font-size:16.5px; color:#555; line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:5px; }\n.gl-prep li:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }\n.gl-prep li b { color:#1a4d99; }\n.gl-cta { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }\n.gl-cta .pt { font-size:15px; color:#999; }\n.gl-cta a { flex-shrink:0; background:#03c75a; color:#fff; font-size:16px; font-weight:800; padding:11px 18px; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"gl-card\">\n  <span class=\"gl-tag\">객관식 13번 · 어법상 틀린 것 (3.2점)</span>\n  <p class=\"gl-title\">원문의 what이 시험지에서 which로 바뀌어 있었다</p>\n  <p class=\"gl-sub\">태원고 영어1 기말고사 · 코코스학원 보유 Reading Booster 워크북 문제32 — 과학철학 문단</p>\n\n  <div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdKxZWfrUo4iRlIM-Ps5HWXayxfF0uqdfOFcMbWcQwGPHtG129-__5n46h9OB-sxLQoziRsr-QIseThNo0hAJk6kZEzS-a44nvoTZSTMNPUsVFeTPBjdlb2del3coxg6n1Wz4rEJt7z4QH9kbi7sbvsarYxozctVk73q3cni3lR7pqleEZscpi36zd7XHz/s1338/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%E1%86%AB%E1%84%89%E1%85%A3%E1%86%BA%202026-08-21%20%E1%84%8B%E1%85%A9%E1%84%8C%E1%85%A5%E1%86%AB%2012.38.19.png\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0; text-align: center; \"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" data-original-height=\"776\" data-original-width=\"1338\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdKxZWfrUo4iRlIM-Ps5HWXayxfF0uqdfOFcMbWcQwGPHtG129-__5n46h9OB-sxLQoziRsr-QIseThNo0hAJk6kZEzS-a44nvoTZSTMNPUsVFeTPBjdlb2del3coxg6n1Wz4rEJt7z4QH9kbi7sbvsarYxozctVk73q3cni3lR7pqleEZscpi36zd7XHz/s320/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%E1%86%AB%E1%84%89%E1%85%A3%E1%86%BA%202026-08-21%20%E1%84%8B%E1%85%A9%E1%84%8C%E1%85%A5%E1%86%AB%2012.38.19.png\"/></a></div>\n\n  <div class=\"gl-finding\">📖 <b>원문 대조 결과 — 원문 \"is what makes science reliable\" → 시험지 \"is which makes science reliable\".</b> 원래는 빈칸추론 문제였고 이 부분은 빈칸과 무관한 문장이었는데, 태원고가 여기에 어법 오류를 새로 심어 문제를 만들었습니다.</div>\n\n  <div class=\"gl-compare\">\n    <div class=\"box orig\"><span class=\"label\">워크북 원문</span><span class=\"val\">is what makes ~ (선행사 포함 관계대명사)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"box exam\"><span class=\"label\">시험지</span><span class=\"val\">is which makes ~ (선행사 없음)</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"gl-h\">밑줄 문장</p>\n  <div class=\"gl-quote\">\"The ability to revise and improve ideas based on new data is <u>④which</u> makes science reliable and trustworthy over time.\"</div>\n\n  <p class=\"gl-h\">정답</p>\n  <div class=\"gl-choice\">\n    <div class=\"row ok\"><span class=\"mark\">✅</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>④ which → what</b><span class=\"why\">be동사 뒤에 선행사 없이 바로 관계사절이 이어지므로 선행사를 포함한 관계대명사 what이 필요</span></span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"gl-prep\">\n    <div class=\"ptitle\">🎯 이렇게 대비하세요</div>\n    <ol>\n      <li><b>\"is/was + 관계사 + 동사\" 구조를 보면 관계사 앞에 선행사가 있는지부터 확인한다</b></li>\n      <li><b>선행사가 없으면 which가 아니라 선행사를 포함한 what이어야 함을 기억한다</b></li>\n      <li><b>나머지 밑줄들(to부정사, 분사, that절, 동명사)도 각각의 문법적 역할을 하나씩 짚어 소거한다</b></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"gl-cta\">\n    <span class=\"pt\">태원고 영어내신 기출 완전분석 시리즈</span>\n    <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/%EC%BD%94%EC%BD%94%EC%8A%A4%ED%95%99%EC%9B%90\" target=\"_blank\">코코스학원 →</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>", "author": {"id": "04783440165843078075", "displayName": "리카수니", "url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04783440165843078075", "image": {"url": "//blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEij7m3uPaqJtF6qA_dfqRr4d9tEsZo_dlxVjEX1jRjybBZql7Kw8ry27dA0fV7SMK2ZO0doLsUCW3qnywwK9fBo6V4RG-xog5avEICcLozp6-6Y5S4EhVssm7E80YhbgdwrIS3tWvNg80AYkO_VySJW4znl3OOr7iDwg3X_7AeTpMViKg/s35/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%E1%86%AB%E1%84%89%E1%85%A3%E1%86%BA%202026-08-01%20%E1%84%8B%E1%85%A9%E1%84%92%E1%85%AE%202.26.48.png"}}, "replies": {"totalItems": "0", "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/blogger/v3/blogs/489843540806914986/posts/2127302986237315165/comments"}, "labels": ["태원고 영어내신", "태원고 영어내신분석", "태원고 영어내신학원"], "etag": "\"dGltZXN0YW1wOiAxNzg3MjU2MzAxNTg3Cm9mZnNldDogLTI1MjAwMDAwCg\""}